+title: "Rent equipment by the hour"
+status: pending
+---
+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold verbatim; `memory submit` replaces
+     these placeholder comments with real content and fills the required frontmatter fields. -->
+
+## What was done
+
+`addEquipment` accepts an optional `hourlyPrice` (non-negative integer cents, validated). `quote` and `book`
+price a rental shorter than a day that starts and ends on a UTC whole hour at `hourlyPrice` per hour. An
+item without an hourly price rejects such a rental. Rentals of a day or more still need UTC midnights.
+Tests added in `test/rental.test.ts` (red first, then green).
